    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Balloon Breaker, the addictive and exhilarating game that will keep you entertained for hours! Your mission is simple but challenging: inflate and pop as many balloons as possible using your trusty mouse.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut be warned, this isn't your ordinary balloon-popping game. In Balloon Breaker, the more balloons you pop, the higher your score climbs!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd if you're a true balloon-popping master, you can aim for special achievements, such as popping a certain number of balloons or popping within a specific time limit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy your balloons!!!",
